            },
            {
                "entry_id": "72b292d4-d466-3bc7-84d5-5efcc17e9f1a",
                "word": "Bob",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9d72b30-24b6-3303-bc11-217656a82a38",
                        "entry_id": "72b292d4-d466-3bc7-84d5-5efcc17e9f1a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tribunal de grande instance de Bobigny."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "83b7f795-4f92-44f5-954b-d287403157f2",
                                "sense_id": "a9d72b30-24b6-3303-bc11-217656a82a38",
                                "text": "\"Elle voulait juste faire prendre conscience de la limite de l'exercice\", analyse un ancien magistrat de \"Bob\". Ce qui est moins habituel, c'est l'écho qu'ont eu les propos de la procureure en dehors du petit monde judiciaire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eba9df9c-9e36-4c99-8b46-d9992e22ad20",
                                "sense_id": "a9d72b30-24b6-3303-bc11-217656a82a38",
                                "text": "Sur le front des violences conjugales, la justice dionysienne n'a pas démérité non plus. En la matière, « Bob » s'est révélé pionnier. Comme avec le protocole « féminicide » […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "85a63b49-a944-3a0b-a629-37daed09d0bf",
                "word": "bob",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "091ac6c2-f856-449c-8645-579eaa733329",
                        "entry_id": "85a63b49-a944-3a0b-a629-37daed09d0bf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "bobs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ef35918-ee18-345e-a17b-9a296c3dfc9b",
                        "entry_id": "85a63b49-a944-3a0b-a629-37daed09d0bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sorte de chapeau mou, souvent publicitaire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86275037-56ab-434d-a90f-f39bad18bdfb",
                                "sense_id": "4ef35918-ee18-345e-a17b-9a296c3dfc9b",
                                "text": "Appuyé contre le véhicule de la gendarmerie, un homme imposant, coiffé d'un bob et vêtu d’un pantalon et d’une chemise en toile, peine à se tenir debout et parle tout seul à voix haute."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d48455d5-97f3-44d9-a59a-06fa31c2e237",
                                "sense_id": "4ef35918-ee18-345e-a17b-9a296c3dfc9b",
                                "text": "Sandy était là, les bras tendus, l’œil moqueur sous son inséparable bob de toile, la narine frémissante, autant de signes qui trahissaient le bonheur de nos retrouvailles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f225da4c-6211-42da-9c33-3ef9184e3b6f",
                        "source_entry_id": "85a63b49-a944-3a0b-a629-37daed09d0bf",
                        "source_sense_id": "4ef35918-ee18-345e-a17b-9a296c3dfc9b",
                        "target_lang_word": "bucket hat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bucket hat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e60ce2e6-b7bd-3173-9dc7-68c617158613",
                                        "entry_id": "8c3a5a57-14ff-3a7a-919c-780a9ee422cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A casual hat often worn at the beach, with a narrow downward-sloping brim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3de439d5-de9b-4bdd-9f72-c24136ebf690",
                                                "sense_id": "e60ce2e6-b7bd-3173-9dc7-68c617158613",
                                                "text": "The beaming smile of David Brooks, proudly wearing his yellow Euro 2020 jersey and a bucket hat, instantly raised the spirits of those on the pitch who spotted the 25-year-old's frantic waving."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcf2f70f-556f-4a54-bd93-c12c659f583d",
                                                "sense_id": "e60ce2e6-b7bd-3173-9dc7-68c617158613",
                                                "text": "Ultimately most people will always think of Gallagher brother-approved trackie tops, bucket hats, parkas and a swagger when they think of Britpop."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "b8280b6f-1cee-3e6a-9f99-6e5f1fa90cf0",
                "word": "bob",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "35413eda-a329-4936-b681-d72275e4cbf2",
